    useCase: "When your child is struggling with anxiety and you want practical strategies to help them cope while knowing when professional support is needed.",
    safetyNote: "This is for informational purposes only. If your child is in crisis or expressing thoughts of self-harm, contact your healthcare provider or the 988 Suicide and Crisis Lifeline immediately.",
