    useCase: "When you want to keep your mind sharp with enjoyable brain exercises and practical memory strategies that fit into your daily life.",
    safetyNote: "This is for informational purposes only. If you are experiencing significant memory changes that affect daily life, consult your healthcare provider for a proper evaluation.",
